<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ultratech Stepper started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ultratech Stepper started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs has initiated coverage of Ultratech Stepper with a rating of market outperform, the brokerage firm said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Joe Moore was unavailable for comment and no further information was released.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the San Jose, Calif-based photolithography equipment maker traded at 21-5/8, up 1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
